{"4912990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Rug Racket", "steam_appid": 4912990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/65b7765ecea3f63059295e735e4e1d20.avif?t=1786981497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras_big/65b7765ecea3f63059295e735e4e1d20.avif?t=1786981497 width=1560 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a one-click clean. Every rug is a five-stage job. Dust, colorfast-test, wash, rinse, extract &amp; dry. Fibers that scorch, dyes that bleed, and stains that set permanently if you reach for the wrong tool or too much heat. Pull the grime back with your own hands and watch a ruined heirloom come back to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/00be28177a6ef53492e8a033b81dbfcb.poster.avif?t=1786981497\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/00be28177a6ef53492e8a033b81dbfcb.webm?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/00be28177a6ef53492e8a033b81dbfcb.mp4?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/d03eba61d92dca3439f5715799455872.avif?t=1786981497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras_big/d03eba61d92dca3439f5715799455872.avif?t=1786981497 width=1560 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherit a failing business and build it into something. Court a roster of demanding customers, manage a three-axis reputation, weigh four upgrade branches, and survive an overhead curve that never stops climbing. Read the room. The Neurotic Collector won't tolerate a speck; the Art Conservator's antique will scorch if you so much as breathe steam on it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/085e32b170de3d4ec03b9425f886dc59.poster.avif?t=1786981497\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/085e32b170de3d4ec03b9425f886dc59.webm?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/085e32b170de3d4ec03b9425f886dc59.mp4?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/81e3f4e9d32ff2de1ce929babd17a86f.avif?t=1786981497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras_big/81e3f4e9d32ff2de1ce929babd17a86f.avif?t=1786981497 width=1560 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't own this shop free and clear. They do. A weekly tribute, rising pressure across a three-act crime arc, police heat, enforcer visits, and a debt that compounds if you ignore it. Claw your way to the buyout and your independence...<br>...or fold, in any number of ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/1bcac34643331cad028db812aa59bbd9.poster.avif?t=1786981497\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/1bcac34643331cad028db812aa59bbd9.webm?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/1bcac34643331cad028db812aa59bbd9.mp4?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/099bfe00cd1b22e2fc0ac0c4a80492cb.avif?t=1786981497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras_big/099bfe00cd1b22e2fc0ac0c4a80492cb.avif?t=1786981497 width=1560 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special jobs flip the rules. <i>The Flood</i> leaves rugs soaking and breeding mold while your tools run at half power. <i>The Stash</i> is mob work with cash sewn into the pile. Clean it presentable, but dig too deep and you'll find what you were never supposed to see. Master restoration mode for the rugs that look beyond saving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/86cc38e62231e6307d3ceef20277ebeb.poster.avif?t=1786981497\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/86cc38e62231e6307d3ceef20277ebeb.webm?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/86cc38e62231e6307d3ceef20277ebeb.mp4?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, tactile cleaning craft. 5 stages, real fiber/colorfast/heat rules, a point-of-no-return for the careless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark-comedy mob story across three acts, with a buyout win and multiple ways to fold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push-your-luck special jobs: The Flood (mold) and The Stash (don't overclean).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a business: customers, reputation, upgrades, events, and legendary moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoration mode for the truly wrecked rugs.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/65b7765ecea3f63059295e735e4e1d20.avif?t=1786981497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras_big/65b7765ecea3f63059295e735e4e1d20.avif?t=1786981497 width=1560 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a one-click clean. Every rug is a five-stage job. Dust, colorfast-test, wash, rinse, extract &amp; dry. Fibers that scorch, dyes that bleed, and stains that set permanently if you reach for the wrong tool or too much heat. Pull the grime back with your own hands and watch a ruined heirloom come back to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/00be28177a6ef53492e8a033b81dbfcb.poster.avif?t=1786981497\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/00be28177a6ef53492e8a033b81dbfcb.webm?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/00be28177a6ef53492e8a033b81dbfcb.mp4?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/d03eba61d92dca3439f5715799455872.avif?t=1786981497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras_big/d03eba61d92dca3439f5715799455872.avif?t=1786981497 width=1560 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherit a failing business and build it into something. Court a roster of demanding customers, manage a three-axis reputation, weigh four upgrade branches, and survive an overhead curve that never stops climbing. Read the room. The Neurotic Collector won't tolerate a speck; the Art Conservator's antique will scorch if you so much as breathe steam on it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/085e32b170de3d4ec03b9425f886dc59.poster.avif?t=1786981497\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/085e32b170de3d4ec03b9425f886dc59.webm?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/085e32b170de3d4ec03b9425f886dc59.mp4?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/81e3f4e9d32ff2de1ce929babd17a86f.avif?t=1786981497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras_big/81e3f4e9d32ff2de1ce929babd17a86f.avif?t=1786981497 width=1560 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't own this shop free and clear. They do. A weekly tribute, rising pressure across a three-act crime arc, police heat, enforcer visits, and a debt that compounds if you ignore it. Claw your way to the buyout and your independence...<br>...or fold, in any number of ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/1bcac34643331cad028db812aa59bbd9.poster.avif?t=1786981497\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/1bcac34643331cad028db812aa59bbd9.webm?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/1bcac34643331cad028db812aa59bbd9.mp4?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/099bfe00cd1b22e2fc0ac0c4a80492cb.avif?t=1786981497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras_big/099bfe00cd1b22e2fc0ac0c4a80492cb.avif?t=1786981497 width=1560 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special jobs flip the rules. <i>The Flood</i> leaves rugs soaking and breeding mold while your tools run at half power. <i>The Stash</i> is mob work with cash sewn into the pile. Clean it presentable, but dig too deep and you'll find what you were never supposed to see. Master restoration mode for the rugs that look beyond saving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/86cc38e62231e6307d3ceef20277ebeb.poster.avif?t=1786981497\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/86cc38e62231e6307d3ceef20277ebeb.webm?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/extras/86cc38e62231e6307d3ceef20277ebeb.mp4?t=1786981497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, tactile cleaning craft. 5 stages, real fiber/colorfast/heat rules, a point-of-no-return for the careless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark-comedy mob story across three acts, with a buyout win and multiple ways to fold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push-your-luck special jobs: The Flood (mold) and The Stash (don't overclean).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a business: customers, reputation, upgrades, events, and legendary moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoration mode for the truly wrecked rugs.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Inherit a rundown rug-cleaning shop and master a satisfying craft. Dust, wash, rinse and revive rugs one stain at a time. Build a reputation, keep the lights on, and squirm out from under the mob family that owns your debt. Every rug's a small win, and every tribute payment says you're not free yet.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/25dc754c61021406a79e4e2a7f4ac6ff6cd2aca4/header.jpg?t=1786981497", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/a8fee1663ac02eb84bc560cd8e1e155246d55786/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786981497", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912990/a8fee1663ac02eb84bc560cd8e1e155246d55786/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786981497", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.4 GHz (Intel Co